# X2: an all-four reset with the heal, then the S3a matrix again on the fixed image: the gate matrix plan on c2-packed-tp4-gate, four
# real-text users (4,096 / 16,384 / 32,768 / 60,000 tokens, 512 tokens out), a concurrent arm (all four at once: packed-4 rounds,
# users 2 and 3 in rows 32-63 of the 64-row block) and a solo arm (the same prompts one at a time: the sequential engine, one tile),
# under the strict policy: every concurrent text must equal its solo text. The same argv as S3a-s2-matrix.env of tp4-s2-jobs, but the
# image.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card exactness window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/exact and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image X0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_GATE_JIT=record: the kernel cache holds no four-card entry for the split shapes, so the first arm compiles them; the growth is
# recorded, not judged.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; per arm one engine build 10-30 min plus 5-15 min of streams; two arms 35-75 min; a reproduced
# divergence re-runs both arms once: up to 150 min. The gate budgets itself against the step limit (380 min).
# Stop rule: the gate exit (strict): any concurrent text differing from its solo text fails the job, and so does an audit mismatch.
# Read: the [PINDIAG] tile-split all-reduce lines (128 engaged per traced forward: 16 wo + 48 GDN out + 64 w2, two tiles each; a
# forward with fewer fails its round); the divergence records (none expected); and the SOLO texts against S3a solo texts offline: the
# solo engine issues one-tile calls, which the wrapper passes through, so they must be byte identical to S3a.
# Proves: concurrent (packed) equals solo (sequential) for all four users, including the two that diverged, on real text at 512 tokens.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-exact-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=matrix
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=4096,16384,32768,60000
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=512
C2_GATE_JIT=record
